1
00:00:00,508 --> 00:00:02,548
(Penny:)So far, the future's great.

2
00:00:05,379 --> 00:00:06,759
(Stuart:)Hey, can I go to the bathroom?

3
00:00:06,914 --> 00:00:08,894
(Raj:)Fine, just try not to look too alive.

4
00:00:09,050 --> 00:00:10,050
(Stuart:)That's my jam.

5
00:00:14,188 --> 00:00:16,138
(Bernadette:)So one of us went back
in time to kill Stuart?

6
00:00:16,290 --> 00:00:19,100
(Amy:)-But why?
-Perhaps this will help.

7
00:00:19,260 --> 00:00:23,540
(Raj:)Here are some facts
about yourselves in the future

8
00:00:23,697 --> 00:00:26,147
(Raj:)that might contain a clue.

9
00:00:27,101 --> 00:00:29,641
(Amy:)Hey, I won
the Nobel Prize in physiology.

10
00:00:29,804 --> 00:00:32,444
(Amy:)Then I used the money to buy
Stuart's comic book store,

11
00:00:32,606 --> 00:00:35,246
(Amy:)and close it down so Sheldon
would pay attention to me.

12
00:00:38,979 --> 00:00:40,649
(Amy:)Not the worst idea.

13
00:00:42,450 --> 00:00:44,900
(Penny:)Hey, I'm a famous actress
living in London.

14
00:00:45,052 --> 00:00:46,792
(Leonard:)I'm a professor at Stanford.

15
00:00:46,954 --> 00:00:49,064
(Bernadette:)So I guess you two are
making it work long distance.

16
00:00:49,223 --> 00:00:51,963
Oh, ho. In this game,
as your careers both took off,

17
00:00:52,126 --> 00:00:54,766
(Raj:)you drifted apart.
Kind of like how future me

18
00:00:54,929 --> 00:00:56,669
(Raj:)lost touch with you guys
after I became boy toy

19
00:00:56,831 --> 00:01:03,021
(Raj:)for the wrinkled,
but still flexible, Madonna.

